<div class="wp-block-iris-advanced-title has-text-align-center wp-block-iris-advanced-title--inversed" id=""><p class="iris-over-title">With the Nice Côte d&#8217;Azur Convention &amp; Visitors Bureau</p><h2 class="h2">Visit Nice</h2></div>
</div>



<div class="wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="flex-basis:33.33%">
<figure class="wp-block-image aligncenter size-full is-resized"><img decoding="async" width="130" height="156" src="https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/app/uploads/2026/01/blason-nice.webp" alt="" class="wp-image-33864" style="width:84px;height:auto"/></figure>
