<div class="wp-block-iris-section  iris-appearance iris-appearance--bleu-fonce iris-appearance--secondary-button " id=""><div class="article">
<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center">See all events</h2>



<div class="wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-button"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/en/explore/towns-villages/coastal-area/nice/events/">Nice events calendar</a></div>
</div>
</div></div>



<div class="wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-button"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/en/tourism-info/office-de-tourisme-nice-cote-dazur-nice-jean-medecin/">See our information office</a></div>
</div>



<hr class="wp-block-separator alignwide has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading">A city of history and light</h3>



<p>Since 2021, Nice has been listed as a <strong><a href="https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/en/explore/unesco-and-heritage/">UNESCO World Heritage</a></strong> Site as a <strong>&#8220;Riviera Winter Resort&#8221;.</strong> This distinction recognises the exceptional heritage of a city shaped by winter visitors who came to admire its light and enjoy its climate.<br>Take a stroll through the districts that gave birth to this art of living: from the <strong>Musiciens district</strong> to <strong>Cimiez</strong>, let yourself be seduced by the architectural richness of its facades, the reinvented <strong><a href="https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/en/culture/gare-du-sud/">Gare du Sud station</a></strong> or the majestic <strong><a href="https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/en/culture/cathedrale-orthodoxe-russe-de-saint-nicolas/">Russian Orthodox Cathedral of Saint-Nicolas</a></strong>.</p>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading">A strong cultural identity in Nice</h3>



<p>As the capital of the Côte d&#8217;Azur, Nice is a destination for art and culture. Its museums, galleries, architecture and festivals make it a veritable open-air museum.<br>Stroll through <strong>Vieux-Nice</strong>, thrill to the <strong><a href="https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/en/culture/promenade-des-anglais/">Promenade des Anglais</a></strong>, push open the door of the <strong><a href="https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/en/culture/musee-matisse-nice/">Musée Matisse</a></strong> or the <strong><a href="https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/en/culture/musee-dart-moderne-et-dart-contemporain-m-a-m-a-c-closed-until-2028/">Musée d&#8217;Art Contemporain</a></strong>, and let yourself be inspired by the city&#8217;s creative energy.</p>



<figure class="wp-block-gallery alignwide has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-2 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex">
<figure class="wp-block-image size-large" aria-label="Photo of a statue in the Matisse Museum"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1024" height="683" data-id="33928" src="https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/app/uploads/2026/01/museematisse-villedenice-1-1-1024x683.webp" alt="Photo of a statue in the Matisse Museum" class="wp-image-33928" srcset="https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/app/uploads/2026/01/museematisse-villedenice-1-1-1024x683.webp 1024w, https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/app/uploads/2026/01/museematisse-villedenice-1-1-300x200.webp 300w, https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/app/uploads/2026/01/museematisse-villedenice-1-1-768x512.webp 768w, https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/app/uploads/2026/01/museematisse-villedenice-1-1-1536x1024.webp 1536w, https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/app/uploads/2026/01/museematisse-villedenice-1-1.webp 1920w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /><figcaption class="wp-element-caption">Matisse Museum</figcaption></figure>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-large" aria-label="Photo of the exterior of the MAMAC"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1024" height="683" data-id="33932" src="https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/app/uploads/2026/01/museedartmoderne-otcn-1-1-1024x683.webp" alt="Photo of the exterior of the MAMAC" class="wp-image-33932" srcset="https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/app/uploads/2026/01/museedartmoderne-otcn-1-1-1024x683.webp 1024w, https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/app/uploads/2026/01/museedartmoderne-otcn-1-1-300x200.webp 300w, https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/app/uploads/2026/01/museedartmoderne-otcn-1-1-768x512.webp 768w, https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/app/uploads/2026/01/museedartmoderne-otcn-1-1-1536x1024.webp 1536w, https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/app/uploads/2026/01/museedartmoderne-otcn-1-1.webp 1920w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /><figcaption class="wp-element-caption">Museum of Modern and Contemporary Art</figcaption></figure>
</figure>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Flavours and know-how from Nice</h3>



<p>Here,<strong> Cuisine Nissarde</strong> is an integral part of our heritage. Moreover, the town promotes its authenticity through the <strong>&#8221; <a href="https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/en/out-and-about/restaurants/restaurants-and-establishments-of-cuisine-nissarde/">Cuisine Nissarde, respecting tradition</a> &#8220;</strong> label <strong>,</strong> awarded each year to around thirty establishments.<br>Try a <strong>socca</strong>, <strong>pan bagnat</strong>, <strong>stuffed sa</strong> usage or <strong>Nicoise salad</strong>: simple, convivial recipes that reflect the people who share them.</p>



<figure class="wp-block-gallery aligncenter has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-3 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex">
<figure class="wp-block-image size-large" aria-label="Pan bagnat at the Lou Balico restaurant"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="683" height="1024" data-id="32128" src="https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/app/uploads/2025/12/pan-bagnat-restaurant-lou-balico-nice-gaia-giuliani10-683x1024.webp" alt="Pan bagnat at the Lou Balico restaurant" class="wp-image-32128" srcset="https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/app/uploads/2025/12/pan-bagnat-restaurant-lou-balico-nice-gaia-giuliani10-683x1024.webp 683w, https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/app/uploads/2025/12/pan-bagnat-restaurant-lou-balico-nice-gaia-giuliani10-200x300.webp 200w, https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/app/uploads/2025/12/pan-bagnat-restaurant-lou-balico-nice-gaia-giuliani10-768x1152.webp 768w, https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/app/uploads/2025/12/pan-bagnat-restaurant-lou-balico-nice-gaia-giuliani10-1024x1536.webp 1024w, https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/app/uploads/2025/12/pan-bagnat-restaurant-lou-balico-nice-gaia-giuliani10-1365x2048.webp 1365w, https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/app/uploads/2025/12/pan-bagnat-restaurant-lou-balico-nice-gaia-giuliani10-scaled.webp 1707w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 683px) 100vw, 683px" /><figcaption class="wp-element-caption">Pan bagnat at the Lou Balico restaurant</figcaption></figure>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-large" aria-label="Farcis niçois at Chez Cane restaurant"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="683" height="1024" data-id="31889" src="https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/app/uploads/2025/12/les-farcis-restaurant-chez-cane-nice-gaia-giuliani16-683x1024.webp" alt="Farcis niçois at Chez Cane restaurant" class="wp-image-31889" srcset="https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/app/uploads/2025/12/les-farcis-restaurant-chez-cane-nice-gaia-giuliani16-683x1024.webp 683w, https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/app/uploads/2025/12/les-farcis-restaurant-chez-cane-nice-gaia-giuliani16-200x300.webp 200w, https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/app/uploads/2025/12/les-farcis-restaurant-chez-cane-nice-gaia-giuliani16-768x1152.webp 768w, https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/app/uploads/2025/12/les-farcis-restaurant-chez-cane-nice-gaia-giuliani16-1024x1536.webp 1024w, https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/app/uploads/2025/12/les-farcis-restaurant-chez-cane-nice-gaia-giuliani16-1365x2048.webp 1365w, https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/app/uploads/2025/12/les-farcis-restaurant-chez-cane-nice-gaia-giuliani16-scaled.webp 1707w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 683px) 100vw, 683px" /><figcaption class="wp-element-caption">Farcis niçois at Chez Cane restaurant</figcaption></figure>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-large" aria-label="Niçoise salad at Le Safari restaurant"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="683" height="1024" data-id="32062" src="https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/app/uploads/2025/12/salade-nicoise-restaurant-le-safari-nice-gaia-giuliani3-683x1024.webp" alt="Niçoise salad at Le Safari restaurant" class="wp-image-32062" srcset="https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/app/uploads/2025/12/salade-nicoise-restaurant-le-safari-nice-gaia-giuliani3-683x1024.webp 683w, https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/app/uploads/2025/12/salade-nicoise-restaurant-le-safari-nice-gaia-giuliani3-200x300.webp 200w, https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/app/uploads/2025/12/salade-nicoise-restaurant-le-safari-nice-gaia-giuliani3-768x1152.webp 768w, https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/app/uploads/2025/12/salade-nicoise-restaurant-le-safari-nice-gaia-giuliani3-1024x1536.webp 1024w, https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/app/uploads/2025/12/salade-nicoise-restaurant-le-safari-nice-gaia-giuliani3-1365x2048.webp 1365w, https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/app/uploads/2025/12/salade-nicoise-restaurant-le-safari-nice-gaia-giuliani3-scaled.webp 1707w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 683px) 100vw, 683px" /><figcaption class="wp-element-caption">Niçoise salad at Le Safari restaurant</figcaption></figure>
</figure>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading">A responsible way of life</h3>



<p>Nice is also committed to sustainable development, confirming its role as a driving force within the Nice Côte d&#8217;Azur metropolitan area. Soft mobility, accredited accommodation, the creation of green spaces and slow tourism are all part of its daily routine.<br>The city&#8217;s many gardens, parks and vantage points offer a breath of fresh air in the heart of the city: <strong><a href="https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/en/culture/promenade-du-paillon/">the Promenade du Paillon</a></strong>, <strong><a href="https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/en/culture/parc-de-la-colline-du-chateau/">Colline du Château</a></strong>, <strong><a href="https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/en/culture/jardin-des-arenes-de-cimiez/">Cimiez</a></strong>, <strong><a href="https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/en/culture/parc-forestier-du-mont-boron/">Mont Boron</a></strong> and <strong><a href="https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/en/culture/parc-phoenix/">Parc Phoenix</a></strong> are all inviting places to relax and contemplate.</p>



<figure class="wp-block-image aligncenter size-full" aria-label="Matisse Museum Nice"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1920" height="1281" src="https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/app/uploads/2025/12/musee-matisse-nice-unesco-olivier-huitel4.webp" alt="Matisse Museum Nice" class="wp-image-27574" srcset="https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/app/uploads/2025/12/musee-matisse-nice-unesco-olivier-huitel4.webp 1920w, https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/app/uploads/2025/12/musee-matisse-nice-unesco-olivier-huitel4-300x200.webp 300w, https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/app/uploads/2025/12/musee-matisse-nice-unesco-olivier-huitel4-1024x683.webp 1024w, https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/app/uploads/2025/12/musee-matisse-nice-unesco-olivier-huitel4-768x512.webp 768w, https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/app/uploads/2025/12/musee-matisse-nice-unesco-olivier-huitel4-1536x1025.webp 1536w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px" /><figcaption class="wp-element-caption">The Nice Matisse Museum in the heart of the Cimiez Arena Park</figcaption></figure>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading">An easy and welcoming destination</h3>



<p>With its international airport, 200 <strong>hotels </strong>, <strong>7km of beaches</strong>, <strong>cultural </strong>and<strong> sporting</strong> events and <strong>countless shops</strong>, Nice is a city to discover all year round.<br>An ideal base for exploring the Côte d&#8217;Azur, it combines comfort, elegance and simple pleasure.</p>



<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>What to see in </strong>Nice</h2>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>Museums: <a href="https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/en/culture/musee-matisse-nice/">Musée Matisse</a>, <a href="https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/en/culture/musee-dart-moderne-et-dart-contemporain-m-a-m-a-c-closed-until-2028/">Musée d&#8217;Art Moderne et d&#8217;Art Contemporain</a>, <a href="https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/en/culture/musee-darcheologie-de-nice-cimiez/">Musée Archéologique</a>, <a href="https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/en/culture/musee-de-la-photographie-charles-negre/">Musée de la Photographie</a>, etc.<br></li>



<li><strong>Architectural heritage </strong>: ancient Baroque palaces, Belle Époque villas, Art Deco facades and contemporary architecture.<br></li>



<li><strong>Old Nice</strong>, with its picturesque streets and craft shops.<br></li>



<li>Colourful markets: fruit, vegetables, flowers, fish and second-hand goods on the <strong><a href="https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/en/culture/cours-saleya/">Cours Saleya</a></strong>, <strong>Libération</strong>, <strong><a href="https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/en/event/marche-de-la-place-du-palais/">Place du Palais</a></strong> and <strong><a href="https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/en/culture/la-place-saint-francois/">Place Saint-François</a></strong>.<br></li>



<li>Gardens and green spaces: <strong><a href="https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/en/culture/parc-de-la-colline-du-chateau/">Colline du Château</a></strong>, <strong><a href="https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/en/culture/promenade-du-paillon/">Promenade du Paillon</a></strong>, <strong><a href="https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/en/culture/jardin-des-arenes-de-cimiez/">Cimiez</a></strong>, <strong><a href="https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/en/culture/parc-forestier-du-mont-boron/">Mont Boron</a></strong>, <strong><a href="https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/en/culture/parc-phoenix/">Parc Phoenix</a></strong>, etc.<br></li>



<li><strong>Panoramic views</strong>: from sunrise to sunset, the <strong><a href="https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/en/culture/promenade-des-anglais/">Promenade des Anglais</a></strong> is a spectacle in itself.</li>
</ul>



<hr class="wp-block-separator alignwide has-alpha-channel-opacity is-style-advanced"/>



